function pendingLabel(url,opt,button){let method=String(opt?.method||"GET").toUpperCase(),path=String(url).replace(/^https?:\/\/[^/]+/,"").split("?")[0],name=(button?.getAttribute("aria-label")||button?.title||"").toLowerCase();if(path.endsWith("/api/login"))return"Signing in…";if(path.endsWith("/api/logout"))return"Signing out…";if(path.endsWith("/api/schedules/import"))return"Importing schedules…";if(/^\/api\/rounds\/[^/]+\/claim$/.test(path))return"Claiming room check…";if(/^\/api\/rounds\/[^/]+\/complete$/.test(path))return"Saving room check…";if(/^\/api\/rounds\/[^/]+\/resolve$/.test(path))return"Resolving issue…";if(/^\/api\/rounds\/[^/]+$/.test(path)&&method==="GET")return"Loading history…";if(path==="/api/buildings"&&method==="POST")return"Adding building…";if(/^\/api\/buildings\/[^/]+$/.test(path))return method==="DELETE"?"Deleting building…":method==="PATCH"?(safePayload(opt).archived?"Archiving building…":"Restoring building…"):"Saving building…";if(path==="/api/rooms/bulk"&&method==="POST")return"Adding rooms…";if(path==="/api/rooms"&&method==="POST")return"Adding room…";if(/^\/api\/rooms\/[^/]+$/.test(path))return method==="DELETE"?"Deleting room…":method==="PATCH"?(safePayload(opt).archived?"Archiving room…":"Restoring room…"):"Saving room…";if(path==="/api/schedules"&&method==="POST")return"Adding schedule…";if(/^\/api\/schedules\/[^/]+$/.test(path))return method==="DELETE"?"Deleting schedule…":method==="PATCH"?(safePayload(opt).archived?"Archiving schedule…":"Restoring schedule…"):method==="PUT"?(name.includes("pause")?"Pausing schedule…":name.includes("resume")?"Resuming schedule…":"Saving schedule…"):"Saving schedule…";if(path==="/api/users"&&method==="POST")return"Creating account…";if(/^\/api\/users\/[^/]+$/.test(path))return method==="DELETE"?"Deleting account…":method==="PATCH"?(safePayload(opt).archived?"Archiving account…":"Restoring account…"):"Saving account…";return method==="GET"?"Loading…":"Saving…"}
